{"unit_id":"QiaoSchoco__dsh-lit-shot#card-zh","repo":"QiaoSchoco/dsh-lit-shot","commit":"5deb47242b692a86a95def60e7f43ea1bc4b383e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-lit-shot 是一个面向 Windows DSH 网页端输入框的区域截图插件。它在会话输入框旁加入剪刀按钮，并由常驻 PowerShell 截图代理提供全屏框选和全局快捷键。用户可点击按钮或按默认 Alt+A 冻结屏幕并拖出矩形区域，截图会裁剪成 PNG 后作为普通图片草稿附件插入；右键按钮可查看或更改快捷键，失败时还可复制图片到剪贴板。适合需要把桌面内容快速附加到 DSH 对话中的 Windows 用户。使用 Windows PowerShell，无需 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:667-676","scripts/agent.ps1:437-449","client.js:388-407"]}
{"unit_id":"QiaoSchoco__dsh-lit-shot#card-en","repo":"QiaoSchoco/dsh-lit-shot","commit":"5deb47242b692a86a95def60e7f43ea1bc4b383e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-lit-shot adds a scissors button and global hotkey to the Windows DSH composer. Select a screen region to crop it as a PNG and insert it as an image draft. The right-click menu changes the shortcut; clipboard fallback is available. Requires Windows PowerShell; no API key or account.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:667-676","scripts/agent.ps1:437-449","client.js:388-407"]}
